        <p class="MsoNormal" style="page-break-after: avoid;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">In December 2023, the FASB issued ASU 2023-09 &#8211; Income taxes: Improvements to Income Tax Disclosures which includes amendments that further enhance income tax disclosures and income taxes paid by jurisdiction. The Company has decided to adopt ASU 2023-09 on a prospective basis. The following table presents the Company&#8217;s provisions for Income Taxes and the provisions calculated at the statutory federal tax rate for the year ended December 31, 2025:</span>
        </p>
