253/283/410</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHCC07629AA82160A50A18A350D93EFB37" xlink:to="HH7712A279C178150E7DCE89B5DB8D5495" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHDB97AEA29A697B71FA970DA30CF83FCA" xlink:label="HHDB97AEA29A697B71FA970DA30CF83FCA" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH1397F646599DA1CB4AF614DC30569D21" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Internal Transmission revenue included in total: $865,544</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHDB97AEA29A697B71FA970DA30CF83FCA" xlink:to="HH1397F646599DA1CB4AF614DC30569D21" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHD2C7E83A687FC6145C3ED8F7D22FC54D" xlink:label="HHD2C7E83A687FC6145C3ED8F7D22FC54D" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH5A7F7366E8D2C29076B7EFE6FD52CB54" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>PTP Transmission Revenue: $156,828</p>
        <p>Other Electric Revenue - ISO ODR: $302,307</p>
        <p>SMART - Energy Market Revenue: $866,285</p>
        <p>SMART - RPS Class I Renewable Generation: $897,778</p>
        <p>Net Metering Energy Market Payments: $1,003,289</p>
        <p>Regional Greenhouse Gas Initiative: $990,065</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHD2C7E83A687FC6145C3ED8F7D22FC54D" xlink:to="HH5A7F7366E8D2C29076B7EFE6FD52CB54" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH271C87190CA322BF10BC7E95B8E0683C" xlink:label="HH271C87190CA322BF10BC7E95B8E0683C" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH8BCD374D291B2D70D9EE284AD4477FAE" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Internal Transmission revenue included in total: $865,544</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH271C87190CA322BF10BC7E95B8E0683C" xlink:to="HH8BCD374D291B2D70D9EE284AD4477FAE" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH8457481C2AFAB5E9C39F95AEFB8A0B6D" xlink:label="HH8457481C2AFAB5E9C39F95AEFB8A0B6D" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHCDD03181FAD5DBA6F7D19EAB609AEF31" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Formula rate adjustment: allocate to transmission by the ratio of internal transmission revenue (Page 304, footnote) to Total Electric Sales to Ultimate Customers (Page 300.10b) less Unbilled Revenue (Page 301, footnote). $865,544 / $72,359,021 + $251,887 = 1.2%</p>
        <p>$3,783,817 * 1.2% = $45,419</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH8457481C2AFAB5E9C39F95AEFB8A0B6D" xlink:to="HHCDD03181FAD5DBA6F7D19EAB609AEF31" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH67518981C67F40F46527E6CDCBE806C5" xlink:label="HH67518981C67F40F46527E6CDCBE806C5" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHE6FC2FDAA6E620B6436890D8B4EC0F6E" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>FG&amp;E purchases from ISO-NE. This would represent unmetered purchases and purchases for basic service supply</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH67518981C67F40F46527E6CDCBE806C5" xlink:to="HHE6FC2FDAA6E620B6436890D8B4EC0F6E" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7944802BADE499071D2E4F15AD851FF9" xlink:label="HH7944802BADE499071D2E4F15AD851FF9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH2A90D42C995B8C66094737CF0B621E40" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>QF payment to Fitchburg Renewables LLC for one month prior to transition to net metering status.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7944802BADE499071D2E4F15AD851FF9" xlink:to="HH2A90D42C995B8C66094737CF0B621E40" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH452F57568E3B34ADA3474D693896AAD4" xlink:label="HH452F57568E3B34ADA3474D693896AAD4" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH4CAE0936FACA3EE6FF3F7CAE622AAF82" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>FG&amp;E purchases a portion of the Pinetree Power Fitchburg wood-burning generator through FG&amp;E's Schedule QF of its retail delivery tariff. In September 2020, Pinetree Power ownership changed to Stored Solar Fitchburg LLC.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH452F57568E3B34ADA3474D693896AAD4" xlink:to="HH4CAE0936FACA3EE6FF3F7CAE622AAF82" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHC05D64D0FA65791FA7E54B79BFCCA032" xlink:label="HHC05D64D0FA65791FA7E54B79BFCCA032" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH224476A054A033568239D5B58B5566E0" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>FG&amp;E Purchases basic service supply from Calpine Energy Solutions</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHC05D64D0FA65791FA7E54B79BFCCA032" xlink:to="HH224476A054A033568239D5B58B5566E0" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH4692685C73899F3BE80E6EB1F6938E57" xlink:label="HH4692685C73899F3BE80E6EB1F6938E57" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH124E680B13EF3B60152833F154898CB0" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Purchases through FG&amp;E's QF and Net Metering Tariffs.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH4692685C73899F3BE80E6EB1F6938E57" xlink:to="HH124E680B13EF3B60152833F154898CB0" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHBADFEA21BBC1765711008E832197ABD2" xlink:label="HHBADFEA21BBC1765711008E832197ABD2" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH5236B508E5D50145187D0071FD45E4A5" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Purchases through FG&amp;E's QF and Net Metering Tariffs.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHBADFEA21BBC1765711008E832197ABD2" xlink:to="HH5236B508E5D50145187D0071FD45E4A5" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH35BC6095CA00F6467ADEA61C8A059BF1" xlink:label="HH35BC6095CA00F6467ADEA61C8A059BF1" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH79B56FCF224383F9D66185F470AA5EB0" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Purchases through FG&amp;E's Long Term Renewable Contract entered into to satisfy the requirements of the Massachusetts Green Communities Act.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH35BC6095CA00F6467ADEA61C8A059BF1" xlink:to="HH79B56FCF224383F9D66185F470AA5EB0" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH75F42A13BFFDB9CF6F46570397C31E01" xlink:label="HH75F42A13BFFDB9CF6F46570397C31E01" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH1C14660F3BFB962AC3C069BC78A034D1" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Purchases through FG&amp;E's Long Term Renewable Contract entered into to satisfy the requirements of the Massachusetts Green Communities Act.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH75F42A13BFFDB9CF6F46570397C31E01" xlink:to="HH1C14660F3BFB962AC3C069BC78A034D1" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH13D580F04B2D0EA26FF5E613D4FE29BB" xlink:label="HH13D580F04B2D0EA26FF5E613D4FE29BB" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH414BDE541DA5F84EF0FB3F0DBCDBB636" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Lines 1.09 - 1.21: Purchase of Massachusetts New Renewable Energy Certificates to meet Massachusetts Renewable Portfolio Standard.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH13D580F04B2D0EA26FF5E613D4FE29BB" xlink:to="HH414BDE541DA5F84EF0FB3F0DBCDBB636" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHE015BA80B7F00D164A11E4EB25641EC5" xlink:label="HHE015BA80B7F00D164A11E4EB25641EC5" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHEC9233A8AD6AD1A8047595A82B0085D4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Keolis (fka Massachusetts Bay Transport Authority (MBTA)).</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHE015BA80B7F00D164A11E4EB25641EC5" xlink:to="HHEC9233A8AD6AD1A8047595A82B0085D4" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH31773C02F4130E01079E252EC3141E9C" xlink:label="HH31773C02F4130E01079E252EC3141E9C" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH2CDB5E1DD2560558EEBD5119B4D61E6F" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Keolis does not contract with Fitchburg Gas and Electric Light Company (&#8220;FGE&#8221;) for its power supply. Keolis is responsible for delivering power to the FGE system. Keolis may have contracted with a wholesale supplier to deliver power to FGE&#8217;s system, but FGE does nothave access to this information.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH31773C02F4130E01079E252EC3141E9C" xlink:to="HH2CDB5E1DD2560558EEBD5119B4D61E6F" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH37784981EDBE691AB4E67847DA4D3C53" xlink:label="HH37784981EDBE691AB4E67847DA4D3C53" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHC27B24AEFF4DA1425B6216A0A83AD377" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>The billing determinant for demand billed to Keolis is the monthly kVa peak, less a 3% discount for primary metering.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH37784981EDBE691AB4E67847DA4D3C53" xlink:to="HHC27B24AEFF4DA1425B6216A0A83AD377" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7919D05142E7614BF49A19399FEACAC4" xlink:label="HH7919D05142E7614BF49A19399FEACAC4" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH8810DAC3A445DCE4C0F0579073D1B093" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>This figure was calculated by multiplying the MWH Delivered in column (j) by one plus the applicable loss factor for this customer (4.48%).</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7919D05142E7614BF49A19399FEACAC4" xlink:to="HH8810DAC3A445DCE4C0F0579073D1B093" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH84FD1DE9881D17468218E48F0999A3AB" xlink:label="HH84FD1DE9881D17468218E48F0999A3AB" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHA7E35833B87F3F27E5F775E998405C6C" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Transmission revenue associated with OATT Schedule 1 and OATT Schedule 9 RNS payments from ISO-NE. OATT Schedule 9 and Schedule 1 RNS payments are allocated pro-rata to the TOs based on their share of the Participating Transmission Owners AdministrativeCommittee (PTO-AC) approved Revenue Requirement. Columns (b, c, i and j): FGE does not have this information. Actual transmission scheduling is conducted by ISO-NE.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH84FD1DE9881D17468218E48F0999A3AB" xlink:to="HHA7E35833B87F3F27E5F775E998405C6C" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHD574F45C2C840A88CE058ABF3A8AC0DA" xlink:label="HHD574F45C2C840A88CE058ABF3A8AC0DA" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHCB5CD7B2D83727B3F7BB31B54273AD08" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>FGE is a distribution company, which purchases transmission service across the ISO New England Inc. (&#8220;ISO-NE&#8221;) bulk transmission system to FGE&#8217;s facilities. FGE pays ISO-NE for transmission service through the ISO New England Inc.Transmission, Markets andServices Tariff. FGE does not have access to data on the losses across the ISO-NE bulk transmission grid, so cannot calculate the volume of Megawatt hours Received. In the ISO-NE market, the cost of losses is accounted for through locational marginal prices. FGE meters the amount of Megawatt hours delivered at its Flagg Pond substation and internal generators.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHD574F45C2C840A88CE058ABF3A8AC0DA" xlink:to="HHCB5CD7B2D83727B3F7BB31B54273AD08" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH2661374B346907EB4E4205AB686CCF77" xlink:label="HH2661374B346907EB4E4205AB686CCF77" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH5FF4BE33C0548DCA09AF4C61D1AE8B75" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Obligation to pay support charges in accordance with Phase II New England Power AC Facilities Support Agreement with New England Power Company.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH2661374B346907EB4E4205AB686CCF77" xlink:to="HH5FF4BE33C0548DCA09AF4C61D1AE8B75" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHFB38DE489C047BA17155792D1049255B" xlink:label="HHFB38DE489C047BA17155792D1049255B" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH4CAA54A5625E722124C82DEB95C4B688" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Obligation to pay support charges in accordance with NSTAR Hydro Quebec Phase II AC Facilities Support Agreement with Eversource Energy.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHFB38DE489C047BA17155792D1049255B" xlink:to="HH4CAA54A5625E722124C82DEB95C4B688" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHE7A87FCD5200B376338349D2F06EF6E5" xlink:label="HHE7A87FCD5200B376338349D2F06EF6E5" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH4E0F832EECA903DE4B3C1C2BCE5CEEF1" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Eversource provides Network Transmission Service under FERC Electric Tariff No. 3, Section II, OATT Schedule 21-ES, Category B Cost.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHE7A87FCD5200B376338349D2F06EF6E5" xlink:to="HH4E0F832EECA903DE4B3C1C2BCE5CEEF1" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH9D5D574A6FCEC58D570EC44EBEB2B1C8" xlink:label="HH9D5D574A6FCEC58D570EC44EBEB2B1C8" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH11B3D99B54FD75A243B60AAD45A7AAD3" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Other charges include Black Start Charges (ISO New England Inc.'s OATT Schedule 16) of -$134,162, Energy Administration Service charges of -$50,100 Reliability Administration Service charges of -$9,713 and Day Ahead Ancillary Services of -$201,834. Black Start and Reliability Must-Run Charges are allocated on the basis of Fitchburg's Network Load."</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH9D5D574A6FCEC58D570EC44EBEB2B1C8" xlink:to="HH11B3D99B54FD75A243B60AAD45A7AAD3" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7C525F8A8C1DFBDF1C8A9F554D4C3FF6" xlink:label="HH7C525F8A8C1DFBDF1C8A9F554D4C3FF6" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH17114CD33A51736731B908D60A079F25" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
Unitil Service Corp. (&#8220;USC&#8221;) provides shared administrative and professional services for its Unitil affiliates, in accordance with Service Agreements with each affiliate company. The costs of the services are accumulated in designated USC accounts and are assigned on a direct or cost-causation basis whenever possible, or allocated to the appropriate affiliate in accordance with guidelines provided. Time for work performed by USC employees for the Utility Client Companies is recorded by functional Job Order Number and charged to the Utility Client Companies. USC costs that are considered general overhead in nature are charged to the Utility Client Companies in relation to the direct time charged.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7C525F8A8C1DFBDF1C8A9F554D4C3FF6" xlink:to="HH17114CD33A51736731B908D60A079F25" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHDD16641080426FE986559947DA86BAA5" xlink:label="HHDD16641080426FE986559947DA86BAA5" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHAD4A74A368DE29AC7F4A283262DDECF9" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Formula rate adjustment: include common plant allocated to electric, page 356. $6,800,618 + $9,003,697 = $15,804,315</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHDD16641080426FE986559947DA86BAA5" xlink:to="HHAD4A74A368DE29AC7F4A283262DDECF9" order="1" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrli:xbrl>